OL,5,G0300 Dermot's Taste of Ireland
OL,6,     FDermot O'Leary heads to the west
OL,7,     Fof Co Donegal for a crash course
OL,8,     Fin the Irish language at
OL,9,     FGlencolmcille Folk Village, before
OL,10,     Fputting his lesson to the test by
OL,11,     Fordering a pint in a local pub.
OL,12,     FDown the road in the fishing town
OL,13,     Fof Killybegs, Dermot gets hands-on
OL,14,     Fwith the Molloy family, learning
OL,15,     Fhow to fillet monkfish like a
OL,16,     Fprofessional
